WEBVTT

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.660
He's here!

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:24.290
What is this place?

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:27.620
I was just in my room, doing some knitting!

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:36.750
Welcome.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:41.250
I am one of the four Dukes of Darkness,
servants of the Demon King.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:46.250
Daughter of Wallen Joannascore Adorian Uljika.

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:51.250
Joanna Joannascore Adorian Uljika!

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:55.200
Demon King of another world, brought
here by the dark gods of darkness...

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:58.620
Help us defeat the hero!

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:03.000
What is your name?

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.910
MAO.

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:05.870
He's the Demon King!

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:09.370
We've succeeded in summoning
the Demon King!

00:01:09.370 --> 00:01:12.700
So you're the Demon King
of another world, huh?

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:22.200
This is the hero summoned
by Princess Altena of Edgardo.

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:23.910
What?

00:01:23.910 --> 00:01:28.080
He fled from the castle after being
summoned, and this poster was--

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:29.450
It's him!

00:01:29.450 --> 00:01:32.410
So this is where he's been hiding?

00:01:32.410 --> 00:01:35.910
Your job is to defeat him.

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:44.000
You don't need to tell me!

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.450
Animal Mask!

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:50.950
The Demon King from
another world knows this hero?

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:52.580
"Knows him"?

00:01:52.580 --> 00:01:55.040
It's a lot more than that!

00:01:55.040 --> 00:02:00.450
It'll take more than a couple words
to describe our relationship!

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:04.250
Wonderful to hear.

00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:06.080
Right, Rose?

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:07.250
Indeed.

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:42.910
"Loser x Master"

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:44.870
What a coincidence.

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:48.660
Or perhaps we should say it's "fate," Joanna?

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:52.870
So the Demon King from
another world hates the hero?

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:57.790
Yes. My own hatred and his,

00:03:57.790 --> 00:04:02.700
if the two of them come together,
the power of the dark side will swell.

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:03.580
Indeed.

00:04:03.580 --> 00:04:08.450
This time, I'll crush her.

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:13.750
My hated foe,
Fafnir Gildomela Grind Lindabulea.

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:20.330
Well done, Joanna.

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:22.000
You're looking good.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:26.200
You may be able to win
the next tournament at this rate!

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:35.700
The winner is Fafnir Gildomela Grind Lindabulea.

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:43.750
Thank you.

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:48.910
Wait!

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:50.290
Yes?

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:52.580
I request a rematch!

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:55.620
A rematch? Now?

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:56.950
Yes!

00:04:58.160 --> 00:04:59.870
Impossible.

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:04.620
Why?

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:07.790
I'm kind of hungry...

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:17.580
This is delicious!

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:24.500
Somebody else's home cooking always
tastes so good compared to your own!

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:26.580
Thank you for the meal!

00:05:26.580 --> 00:05:29.870
I lost to somebody like this?

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:32.120
Shall we begin, then?

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:38.450
One more time!

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:40.620
Just one more time!

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:47.950
The sky's so blue...

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:55.450
Why?

00:05:55.450 --> 00:06:02.080
She was the first person
to ever defeat me in combat.

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:05.870
After that, I became obsessed with her.

00:06:05.870 --> 00:06:09.950
I watched her to find out
the secret of her strength,

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:13.910
but I never could figure out
where her power came from,

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:20.500
or actually, how I lost to a girl
who can't do anything but eat!

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:23.120
Like that time, for instance...

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:26.200
Joanna?

00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:31.080
Hurry up, Mistress.

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:32.370
Carmilla.

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:36.410
So that's the lesser vampire
that serves the dragons?

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:40.120
All four dukes' families
are coming to this party!

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:42.620
Let's be nice and energetic, Mistress.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:49.160
I heard the nation's finest chefs
will be doing the cooking...

00:06:49.160 --> 00:06:51.040
Really?

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:52.500
Let's hurry, then.

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:53.580
Okay!

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:01.450
Hey!

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:06.660
It's been a long time, Lindabulea.

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:09.790
Umm...

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:14.540
Have you forgotten?
She's Joanna Joannascore Adorian Uljika!

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:16.160
Aaah!

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:19.160
"Aaah"? "Aaah"?

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:20.330
Hi there.

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:22.450
Bye there!

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:24.500
Wait!

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:25.790
What do you want?

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:27.410
I'm in a hurry.

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:30.160
The nation's finest chefs
are doing the cooking.

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:33.500
If I don't hurry the food will run out!

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:35.700
You're as hungry as ever, huh?

00:07:35.700 --> 00:07:38.250
Thanks for the kind words!

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:39.950
They weren't kind!

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:47.830
Your servant there is a lesser vampire, right?

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:53.080
Lindabulea, as you know,
there are three classes of vampires.

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:55.700
First, the great ancestors. Then, the elders.

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:58.040
Then beneath them both, the lessers.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:02.040
Of course, my servant, Rose,
is an elder vampire.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:03.910
And?

00:08:03.910 --> 00:08:08.500
At her rank, she shouldn't be able to serve
the family of one of the four dukes' daughters.

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:11.870
Lindabulea, I knew you were strange,

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:14.580
but I think you should put more
thought into choosing your servants.

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:17.250
She didn't choose me!

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:19.500
I begged to serve her!

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:20.330
Shut up.

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:24.330
You're not worthy to speak
to Joanna, lesser vampire.

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:30.040
Lindabulea, if you like,
I can use my authority

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:35.120
to get you a servant of the proper status.

00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:39.200
I heard rumors about Carmilla.
She's a total loser.

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:43.290
I'm sure even a girl like
Lindabulea must be sick of her.

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:46.330
Well, Lindabulea?

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:47.950
You're thinking about it?

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:50.250
You're thinking about it, Mistress?

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:53.200
Please don't think about it!

00:08:50.250 --> 00:08:53.200
I'll send her an elder vampire that's

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:57.950
under my control and find out her weaknesses!

00:08:57.950 --> 00:08:58.950
Well?

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:01.000
Thanks for the offer, but no.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:05.000
Very well. I'll have preparations
made immediately...

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:07.620
Did you just refuse?

00:09:07.620 --> 00:09:10.250
Yes! Now, bye!

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:11.290
Wait!

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:12.620
You don't understand!

00:09:12.620 --> 00:09:14.250
She's almost completely useless!

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:16.620
I know!

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:21.370
It's an embarrassment to our clan to
allow a woman like that to serve a lady.

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:27.290
So, how about we put my Rose
and your Carmilla to the test?

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:30.950
If Carmilla can win, I'll accept her.

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:32.950
Carmilla!

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:35.830
Very well!

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:37.370
Mistress!

00:09:37.370 --> 00:09:39.620
We'll work out the details later!

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:41.620
Why did you accept?

00:09:41.620 --> 00:09:44.950
'Cause if I don't hurry the food will run out!

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:46.540
That's not a good reason!

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:48.080
She's an elder vampire!

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:50.330
I'm going to lose!

00:09:50.330 --> 00:09:52.120
Carmilla.

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:56.450
If you want to be my servant, then work hard.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:09:58.370
Mistress...

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:01.290
Now let's hurry!

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:02.910
I'm starving!

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:04.290
Okay!

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.580
All according to plan.

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:09.450
This time, I'll win.

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:35.660
I've been waiting!

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:38.080
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:10:38.080 --> 00:10:40.830
Let's go over this one
more time before the fight.

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:43.540
If Rose wins, you'll fire Carmilla

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:47.330
and replace her with an elder
vampire that I recommend.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:48.950
Okay!

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:58.080
Let us begin.

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:07.120
Here I go!

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:09.870
The battle is over.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:16.620
It's not over yet...

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:33.620
It's clear who's stronger.

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:37.830
A lesser vampire can't beat an elder vampire.

00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:40.830
Now tell her to surrender.

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:45.410
It's the least you can do for
someone who's been your servant.

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:55.080
Even if I die, I will never admit defeat...

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:59.410
Elder or ancestor, I'll fight
for the Mistress's sake.

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:00.160
You don't know when to give up.

00:13:00.160 --> 00:13:01.700
I can't give up...

00:13:00.160 --> 00:13:01.700
You don't know when to give up.

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:03.120
I can't give up...

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:03.120
Admit that you'll never be

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:04.790
as strong as me...

00:13:04.790 --> 00:13:06.790
I can't lose!

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:08.160
Hey, stop it!

00:13:08.160 --> 00:13:10.160
Don't grab my skirt! You'll pull it off!

00:13:10.160 --> 00:13:11.000
Stop it!

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:15.660
I can't lose! I can't lose!

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:17.450
Stop it!

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:20.160
Let me go!

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:25.200
Let me go! Let me go! Come on, let go!

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:27.790
I request that the battle be stopped.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:30.450
Carmilla can't win.

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:34.580
There's no meaning in continuing to fight.

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:36.540
Enough. Stop.

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:39.000
The winner is Rose.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:41.290
It wasn't even a fight.

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:53.830
I lose...

00:13:57.330 --> 00:14:01.370
But I don't want to leave her!

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:04.580
What are you talking about?
You lost, lesser vampire!

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:08.040
Please, Mistress!

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:12.160
Please!

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.870
Give it up.

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:18.790
I'll send you your new servant tomorrow.

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:21.700
A talented elder vampire.

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:23.120
Take her.

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:25.160
Wait.

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:27.950
Carmilla is a loser, yes.

00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:30.750
But I can't just abandon her.

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:36.950
I'd like to continue using her...

00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:39.540
What's this nonsense?

00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:42.200
I certainly didn't expect that.

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:46.950
If you're going to go back on your promise,

00:14:46.950 --> 00:14:50.330
you'll have to give me something in exchange.

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:52.870
In exchange?

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:18.500
Mistress, what are you doing?

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:24.290
She'd go that far for her?

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:27.200
For the first time, I think I've won!

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:35.330
Rose, let's go.

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:38.200
Joanna, what do we do with her?

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:40.330
Leave her.

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:41.870
As you wish.

00:15:51.660 --> 00:15:54.160
I can't believe she got on her knees!

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:56.160
That's right.

00:15:56.160 --> 00:15:59.290
She's not my foe anymore.

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:03.290
Yes. She looked pathetic.

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:13.580
What?

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:26.040
Lindabulea...

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:29.660
The moon's so beautiful tonight.

00:16:31.500 --> 00:16:33.790
I apologize for earlier.

00:16:33.790 --> 00:16:37.580
Carmilla's such an embarrassment sometimes...

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:39.910
She fails at any task you give her.

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:41.410
She's the biggest loser I've ever seen.

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:43.540
A fool like none other.

00:16:43.540 --> 00:16:48.040
If you thought so,
then you should've gotten rid of her.

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:51.950
But even if she goes about it
in the wrong way sometimes,

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:56.830
she does everything
she can for me, her master.

00:16:56.830 --> 00:17:00.330
And I always feel so at ease
when she's around.

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:02.290
And that's why...

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:06.120
She's very precious to me.

00:17:07.120 --> 00:17:08.910
What are you saying?

00:17:08.910 --> 00:17:12.160
You want me to apologize to her? Accept her?

00:17:12.160 --> 00:17:14.250
Is that why you're here?

00:17:14.250 --> 00:17:19.120
No. She's always been a loser,
and there's no helping that.

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:24.290
And it was a fair fight. I'm not going
to complain about her losing.

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:27.000
Then what did you come to do?

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:33.120
The Fafnirs are the most warlike
of the four houses.

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:37.450
If she loses and I don't do something,
the rest of the family

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:39.540
will never shut up about it.

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:40.830
I see.

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:45.540
So you want me to never tell
anybody that Carmilla lost?

00:17:45.540 --> 00:17:48.450
Then you'll have to pay.

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:52.040
You've already humiliated
yourself by kneeling before me.

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:55.000
So now you'll need to do
something even greater.

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:57.910
Oh, that's not what I want at all.

00:17:57.910 --> 00:18:02.200
I'll just ask for a moment of your time.

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:06.620
What? Are you going to strip naked and beg?

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:08.330
You don't have to go that far!

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:09.870
What are you doing?

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:14.330
Oh, no. My clothing would rip, that's all.

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:22.250
A lady must remain in control
at all times, I've been taught.

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:25.870
But it seems I still have a lot to learn.

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:29.290
Even a dummy like her is a dear servant to me.

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:32.700
I'm sure she's very upset right now.

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:38.330
So as her master,
I think I need to take revenge.

00:18:41.290 --> 00:18:46.200
I, Fafnir Gildomela Grind Lindabulea,

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:51.370
challenge you to a duel!

00:18:57.250 --> 00:19:00.290
Just thinking about it makes my blood boil!

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:02.830
Yes, I feel the same way.

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:05.160
My spies tell me that Lindabulea

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:09.790
left her castle right after
the hero was summoned.

00:19:09.790 --> 00:19:12.330
She probably intends to find him
before anybody else

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:15.450
so she can have the glory to herself.

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:18.660
I thought she was only interested in food.

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:20.250
I can't believe she got the jump on us.

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:23.410
I'll defeat the hero myself!

00:19:23.410 --> 00:19:26.450
I can't let her get to him first!

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:27.910
Of course.

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:31.080
I'll find her,

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:34.580
and this time, I'll crush her!

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:45.290
The lady Joanna requests that you
take any weapons you like.

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:49.120
Using any of this stuff
would be against the rules!

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:56.330
It's been long enough.

00:19:56.330 --> 00:19:58.290
It's time to go on a quest.

00:19:58.290 --> 00:19:59.450
Not yet.

00:19:59.450 --> 00:20:00.870
Until I recover from all the wounds

00:20:00.870 --> 00:20:04.080
I took during yesterday's quest
here in this impure soil,

00:20:04.080 --> 00:20:06.200
I'm not taking a single step.

00:20:06.200 --> 00:20:08.790
You're talking like you actually did something.

00:20:08.790 --> 00:20:12.040
Feel free to thank me at any time, Genzo.

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:13.250
Thank you?

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:15.700
I can't believe you're saying that.

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:18.580
I did my best to stop you, but...

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:19.870
Stop!

00:20:19.870 --> 00:20:24.250
Mistress! I'll get a nice snack for you!

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:30.870
...you ran on ahead and got eaten!

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:34.000
Now get out of there and work.

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:35.580
Stop it!

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:35.580
Get out. Get out. Get out.

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:37.540
Stop slapping my face!

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:37.540
Get out. Get out. Get out.

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:40.080
Get out. Get out. Get out.

00:20:46.450 --> 00:20:49.120
Goodbye, then.

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:12.830
Mistress...

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:17.250
Mistress!

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:19.660
You're back!

00:21:19.660 --> 00:21:21.540
I'm so glad!

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:28.080
I was so worried you'd given up
all hope for me and run away!

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:34.410
I was just about to cure my wounds as
fast as possible and go looking for you!

00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:36.580
Where have you been?

00:21:36.580 --> 00:21:41.370
I was so worried I couldn't sleep!

00:21:42.950 --> 00:21:45.950
Mistress...

00:21:57.120 --> 00:22:00.950
Sheesh... She's so dumb.

00:22:00.950 --> 00:22:02.830
Maybe I'll just bury you here!

00:22:02.830 --> 00:22:06.910
Fine, I'll let you go for today!

